+## Effective settings in constrained dosing modes
+
+In [Basal Testing](../closed-loop.md#basal-testing), the effective Autosens Min and Max are both 100%, and Dynamic ISF / sigmoid are disabled. These derived values preserve the saved preferences. Low Glucose Suspend derives Max IOB 0 but does not impose those additional sensitivity constraints. Read [Dosing Modes](../closed-loop.md) when interpreting displayed or exported settings.
